{
  "$comment": "VAPP-85: the ONE declarative macro table. A macro component (core.catalog.json `kind: macro`) expands into this template before painting; the TS reference expander (src/macros.ts) and the Rust core apply the same table and fixtures/catalog-macros.json locks the output. Template node = { part, component, props?, style?, children?, slots?, $if?, $any?, $each?, $as?, $on?, $context?, $set?, $recipe?, $a11y? }. Values: `\"{props.x}\"` alone = the raw prop (a data BINDING passes through untouched, so two-way binding survives); `\"{props.x|fallback}\"` = with a default; `{…}` inside a longer string interpolates; `{id}` = the macro node's id; `{len(props.rows)}` = an array length; `{range(props.max|5)}` = the indexes 0..n-1 (for `$each`); `{index}` = the current $each index; `{!path}` negates. Value objects: $map {from, cases, default}, $cond [condition, then, else], $eq [a, b] (a number equals a string spelling it), $lt [a, b], $add [a, b], $sub [a, b], $clamp [value, min, max] (a missing bound does not clamp), $percent [value, max] (→ \"N%\"), $coalesce [a, b, …], $text value (→ the value as a string, absent when missing), $not condition, $fill [template, {name: value}] (ALWAYS emits the core `fill` call: the template is usually a `$string.<id>` sentence with `{name}` placeholders the surface's string table resolves at bind time). Object KEYS interpolate too (`\"@media (max-width: $breakpoint.{props.collapseBelow|md})\"`). `$if` = a condition or an array of conditions (all must hold); `$any` = an array where one must hold. `$each` repeats a part per item of an array (`$as` names the item, default `item`). Children: `\"$children\"` splices the author's children, `\"$slot:name\"` splices an author slot in place; `slots: {\"trigger\": \"$slot:trigger\"}` copies an author slot, `slots: {\"footer\": {template node}}` builds one as a part. `$on: {\"press\": \"change\"}` routes the author's `on.change` handler to this part's `press` (merging `$context` into an event action's context); without `$on` the author's `on` map stays on the root. `$set: {\"press\": {\"prop\": \"open\", \"value\": \"{!props.open}\"}}` = TWO-WAY BINDING (round 1): when the author's `props.open` is a data binding `{path}`, this part's `press` action also carries `function: {call: \"set\", args: {path, value}}` (the value evaluated like any template value, so usually a call), key order `event` then `function`; a literal prop adds nothing (the host owns the state through the routed event); when the author's routed handler is itself a FUNCTION (an Action carries one), it wins, no `set` is added and the reducer reports an issue. `$a11y: {role, label, description, level, expanded, current, selected, pressed, checked, valueNow, valueMin, valueMax, hidden, autoFocus}` = the part's ACCESSIBILITY (docs/round-1-contract.md §6): evaluated like props (a bound input emits a call) into the expanded node's `accessibility`; `role` is one of catalog/a11y.json `roles`; on the root the author's `accessibility` label/description win. Ids: the root keeps the author's id, parts get `<id>.<part>` and `<id>.<part>.<index>` under `$each`. Every expanded node carries `recipe: {macro, part, props}` where props = `recipeProps` evaluated from the author's props (+ a part's `$recipe`); the THEME (VAPP-92) keys its visual recipes on that, so nothing here states a colour, a border or a font — only structure and token-named spacing, radius and control heights. Macros may use other macros (NavRow → Row → TreeGuides, Badge); expansion recurses until every node is native (innermost recipe wins). ROUND 1 (docs/round-1-contract.md §1, BOUND INPUTS): when an expression input is a data binding `{path}` or a function call, the expander does NOT evaluate — it EMITS an A2UI function call the renderer evaluates at bind time, over the core functions: interpolation → concat, `|fallback` → fallback (as an operand; a whole-string MEMBER of props/style/context passes the binding itself through, so two-way binding survives), `!` → not, len → len, $map → map, $cond → cond, $eq → eq, $lt → lt, $add → add, $sub → sub, $percent → percent, $text → text, $coalesce → coalesce, $not → not; a `$if`/`$any` whose conditions are bound emits the part WITH `visible` = the bound condition (`and{values}` over several bound `$if`s, `or{values}` over several bound `$any`s; literal conditions still decide at expansion); `$each` over a bound array emits nothing (use List with a template); a `$recipe` value may therefore be a call too (renderers resolve recipe props like props). RESPONSIVE PROPS: an author prop `{base, sm?, md?, lg?, xl?}` on a `responsive` prop is evaluated per breakpoint: a part's style is computed with the `base` values, then once per breakpoint named (ascending sm<md<lg<xl, each key inheriting the last smaller one) and every key that changed lands in a `\"@media (min-width: $breakpoint.<bp>)\"` block of that part; props and conditions see the `base` value. Strings of the form `$string.<id>` (catalog/strings.json) are built-in UI copy the renderer shows in the surface locale. Round 3 (VAPP-102): AFTER the table is applied the core runs ONE post-expansion pass, src/tree-guides.ts applyTreeGuides (Rust: tree_guides::apply): over every node's children in order, each Row root (`recipe.macro` Row, part root) contributes its numeric `recipe.props.depth` (anything else counts as depth 0 and ends every subtree), the ×4 treeGuides rule (elbow at depth-1, tee while a later sibling follows, pass-through for every ancestor level that continues) fills the Row's `guides` part (a TreeGuides) with `elbowAt`/`tee`/`passThrough`; fixtures/tree-guides.json locks the rule, catalog-macros.json the filled trees.",
  "macros": {
    "Stack": {
      "recipeProps": [],
      "root": {
        "part": "root", "component": "Box",
        "style": {
          "display": "flex",
          "flexDirection": { "$map": { "from": "props.direction", "cases": { "horizontal": "row" }, "default": "column" } },
          "flexWrap": { "$cond": ["props.wrap", "wrap", "nowrap"] },
          "gap": "$spacing.{props.gap|md}",
          "alignItems": "{props.align|stretch}",
          "justifyContent": { "$map": { "from": "props.justify", "cases": { "between": "space-between", "around": "space-around", "evenly": "space-evenly" }, "default": "{props.justify|start}" } }
        },
        "children": ["$children"]
      }
    },
    "Grid": {
      "recipeProps": [],
      "root": {
        "part": "root", "component": "Box",
        "style": {
          "display": "grid",
          "gridTemplateColumns": "repeat({props.columns|2}, minmax(0, 1fr))",
          "gap": "$spacing.{props.gap|md}"
        },
        "children": ["$children"]
      }
    },
    "Card": {
      "recipeProps": [],
      "root": {
        "part": "root", "component": "Box", "$a11y": { "role": "group", "label": "{props.title}" },
        "style": { "display": "flex", "flexDirection": "column", "borderRadius": "$radius.xl", "overflow": "hidden" },
        "children": [
          {
            "part": "header", "component": "Box", "$any": ["props.title", "props.description"],
            "style": { "display": "flex", "flexDirection": "column", "gap": "$spacing.xxs", "paddingTop": "$spacing.lg", "paddingHorizontal": "$spacing.lg" },
            "children": [
              { "part": "title", "component": "Text", "$if": "props.title", "props": { "text": "{props.title}", "variant": "title" } },
              { "part": "description", "component": "Text", "$if": "props.description", "props": { "text": "{props.description}", "variant": "muted" } }
            ]
          },
          {
            "part": "body", "component": "Box",
            "style": { "display": "flex", "flexDirection": "column", "gap": "$spacing.md", "padding": { "$map": { "from": "props.padded", "cases": { "false": "$spacing.none" }, "default": "$spacing.lg" } } },
            "children": ["$children"]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "Separator": {
      "recipeProps": [],
      "root": {
        "part": "root", "component": "Box", "$a11y": { "role": "separator" },
        "style": {
          "alignSelf": "stretch",
          "flexShrink": 0,
          "width": { "$map": { "from": "props.orientation", "cases": { "vertical": 1 }, "default": "auto" } },
          "height": { "$map": { "from": "props.orientation", "cases": { "vertical": "auto" }, "default": 1 } }
        }
      }
    },
    "Section": {
      "recipeProps": ["tint", "tree", "open", "collapsible"],
      "root": {
        "part": "root", "component": "Box",
        "style": { "display": "flex", "flexDirection": "column", "gap": "$spacing.xs" },
        "children": [
          {
            "part": "header", "component": "Box", "$if": "props.title",
            "$a11y": { "role": { "$cond": ["props.collapsible", "button", "heading"] }, "level": 3, "expanded": { "$cond": ["props.collapsible", "{props.open|true}"] } },
            "props": { "pressable": "{props.collapsible|false}" },
            "style": { "display": "flex", "flexDirection": "row", "alignItems": "center", "gap": "$spacing.sm", "height": "$control.row", "paddingHorizontal": "$spacing.md", "borderRadius": "$radius.md" },
            "$on": { "press": "change" },
            "$context": { "open": "{!props.open}" },
            "$set": { "press": { "prop": "open", "value": "{!props.open}" } },
            "children": [
              { "part": "chevron", "component": "Icon", "$if": "props.collapsible", "props": { "name": "ui-chevron-right", "size": "sm", "tone": "neutral" } },
              "$slot:leading",
              { "part": "icon", "component": "Icon", "$if": "props.icon", "props": { "name": "{props.icon}", "size": "sm" } },
              { "part": "title", "component": "Text", "props": { "text": "{props.title}", "variant": "label", "lines": 1 }, "style": { "flexShrink": 1, "minWidth": 0 } },
              { "part": "caption", "component": "Text", "$if": "props.caption", "props": { "text": "{props.caption}", "variant": "muted", "lines": 1 }, "style": { "flexShrink": 1, "minWidth": 0 } },
              { "part": "count", "component": "Text", "$if": "props.count", "props": { "text": { "$text": "props.count" }, "variant": "muted" } },
              { "part": "spacer", "component": "Box", "style": { "flexGrow": 1, "minWidth": 0 } },
              "$slot:trailing"
            ]
          },
          {
            "part": "body", "component": "List", "$if": "props.open|true",
            "$a11y": { "role": { "$cond": ["props.tree", "tree", "list"] } },
            "props": { "divided": true, "gap": "none", "style": "{props.style}" },
            "children": ["$children"]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "Band": {
      "recipeProps": [],
      "root": { "part": "root", "component": "Section", "props": { "title": "{props.title}", "count": "{props.count}", "icon": "{props.icon}" } }
    },
    "RowList": {
      "recipeProps": [],
      "root": { "part": "root", "component": "Section", "props": { "tree": "{props.guides|false}", "style": "{props.style}" }, "children": ["$children"] }
    },
    "Group": {
      "recipeProps": [],
      "root": {
        "part": "root", "component": "Box", "$a11y": { "role": "group", "label": "{props.title}", "description": "{props.footer}" },
        "style": { "display": "flex", "flexDirection": "column", "gap": "$spacing.xs" },
        "children": [
          { "part": "title", "component": "Text", "$if": "props.title", "props": { "text": "{props.title}", "variant": "label" }, "style": { "paddingHorizontal": "$spacing.md" } },
          {
            "part": "body", "component": "Box",
            "style": { "display": "flex", "flexDirection": "column", "borderRadius": "$radius.lg", "overflow": "hidden" },
            "children": ["$children"]
          },
          { "part": "footer", "component": "Text", "$if": "props.footer", "props": { "text": "{props.footer}", "variant": "muted" }, "style": { "paddingHorizontal": "$spacing.md" } }
        ]
      }
    },
    "Heading": {
      "recipeProps": ["level"],
      "root": { "part": "root", "component": "Text", "$a11y": { "role": "heading", "level": { "$map": { "from": "props.level", "cases": { "h1": 1, "h2": 2, "h3": 3, "h4": 4 }, "default": 2 } } }, "props": { "text": "{props.text}", "variant": "title" } }
    },
    "Collapsible": {
      "recipeProps": [],
      "root": {
        "part": "root", "component": "Box",
        "style": { "display": "flex", "flexDirection": "column", "gap": "$spacing.xs" },
        "children": [
          {
            "part": "trigger", "component": "Box", "$a11y": { "role": "button", "expanded": "{props.open|false}" }, "props": { "pressable": true },
            "style": { "display": "flex", "flexDirection": "row", "alignItems": "center", "gap": "$spacing.sm", "minHeight": "$control.row", "paddingHorizontal": "$spacing.sm", "borderRadius": "$radius.md" },
            "$recipe": { "open": "{props.open|false}" },
            "$on": { "press": "change" }, "$context": { "open": "{!props.open}" }, "$set": { "press": { "prop": "open", "value": "{!props.open}" } },
            "children": [
              { "part": "chevron", "component": "Icon", "props": { "name": "ui-chevron-right", "size": "sm", "tone": "neutral" }, "$recipe": { "open": "{props.open|false}" } },
              { "part": "title", "component": "Text", "props": { "text": "{props.title}", "variant": "label", "lines": 1 }, "style": { "flexGrow": 1, "minWidth": 0 } },
              { "part": "count", "component": "Text", "$if": "props.count", "props": { "text": { "$text": "props.count" }, "variant": "muted" } }
            ]
          },
          { "part": "body", "component": "Box", "$if": "props.open", "style": { "display": "flex", "flexDirection": "column", "gap": "$spacing.md", "paddingHorizontal": "$spacing.sm" }, "children": ["$children"] }
        ]
      }
    },
    "Pagination": {
      "recipeProps": [],
      "root": {
        "part": "root", "component": "Box", "$a11y": { "role": "navigation", "label": "$string.pagination" },
        "style": { "display": "flex", "flexDirection": "row", "alignItems": "center", "gap": "$spacing.sm" },
        "children": [
          { "part": "prev", "component": "Button", "props": { "icon": "ui-chevron-left", "variant": "outline", "size": "icon", "label": "$string.previous", "disabled": { "$not": { "$lt": [1, "{props.page|1}"] } } }, "$on": { "press": "change" }, "$context": { "page": { "$clamp": [{ "$add": ["{props.page|1}", -1] }, 1, "{props.totalPages}"] } }, "$set": { "press": { "prop": "page", "value": { "$clamp": [{ "$add": ["{props.page|1}", -1] }, 1, "{props.totalPages}"] } } } },
          { "part": "label", "component": "Text", "props": { "text": "{props.page|1} / {props.totalPages}", "variant": "muted" }, "$a11y": { "role": "status", "label": { "$fill": ["$string.pageOf", { "page": "{props.page|1}", "total": "{props.totalPages}" }] } } },
          { "part": "next", "component": "Button", "props": { "icon": "ui-chevron-right", "variant": "outline", "size": "icon", "label": "$string.next", "disabled": { "$not": { "$lt": ["{props.page|1}", "{props.totalPages}"] } } }, "$on": { "press": "change" }, "$context": { "page": { "$clamp": [{ "$add": ["{props.page|1}", 1] }, 1, "{props.totalPages}"] } }, "$set": { "press": { "prop": "page", "value": { "$clamp": [{ "$add": ["{props.page|1}", 1] }, 1, "{props.totalPages}"] } } } }
        ]
      }
    },
    "ButtonGroup": {
      "recipeProps": [],
      "root": { "part": "root", "component": "Segmented", "props": { "items": "{props.buttons}", "value": "{props.selected}", "variant": "outline", "size": "{props.size|default}" }, "$on": { "change": "change" } }
    },
    "Sheet": {
      "recipeProps": [],
      "root": {
        "part": "root", "component": "Drawer",
        "props": { "title": "{props.title}", "description": "{props.description}", "open": "{props.open|false}", "side": "bottom" },
        "slots": { "trigger": "$slot:trigger", "footer": "$slot:footer" },
        "$on": { "change": "change" },
        "children": ["$children"]
      }
    },
    "Badge": {
      "recipeProps": ["variant"],
      "root": {
        "part": "root", "component": "Box",
        "style": { "display": "flex", "flexDirection": "row", "alignItems": "center", "gap": "$spacing.xxs", "height": "$control.badge", "paddingHorizontal": "$spacing.sm", "borderRadius": "$radius.full", "alignSelf": "flex-start" },
        "children": [
          { "part": "icon", "component": "Icon", "$if": "props.icon", "props": { "name": "{props.icon}", "size": "sm" } },
          { "part": "label", "component": "Text", "props": { "text": "{props.text}", "variant": "caption", "lines": 1 } }
        ]
      }
    },
    "Alert": {
